{% doc %}
  Renders a shared, premium policy-page layout for the store's legal pages
  (Privacy Policy, Return & Exchange / Refund Policy, Terms & Conditions,
  Shipping & Delivery Policy).

  The policy's existing title and body are rendered exactly as-is inside a
  wide, clean white content area - only the presentation is styled here. No
  wording, numbering, headings, or other content is altered, and the header
  and footer of the store are untouched.

  Uses the AutoDrapes design tokens (Manrope typography and maroon accents)
  for a consistent premium reading experience that
  is fully responsive on mobile, tablet, and desktop.

  @param {page} policy - The policy page object to render

  @example
  {% render 'policy-page', policy: page %}
{% enddoc %}

<div class="ad-policy">
  <div class="ad-policy__container">
    <h1 class="ad-policy__title">{{ policy.title }}</h1>

    <div class="ad-policy__body">
      {{ policy.content }}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .ad-policy__container {
    position: relative;
  }
</style>

